📢Fully funded PhD opportunity at the University of Galway  of Galway in September 2027 (or earlier).

📌Research areas include embodied AI, networked multi-agent systems, control of robotics and unmanned systems, game theory and optimization, and applications of multi-agent systems.

📍Who I am looking for
Background in control theory, robotics, AI, or a related area (strong maths skills and/or hands-on robotics experience are a plus);
Excellent academic record;
IELTS 6.5  overall, with no band below 6.0;
Self-motivated, honest, and responsible.

📕What you will get
Access to robotic platforms (manipulators, unmanned ground vehicles, and more) with technical support;
Joint research projects with international academics and industry partners;
Opportunities for research visits to leading universities in Europe, North American and China.

🖍️How to apply
Email a single PDF to me at Panpan.zhou@universityofgalway.ie containing: CV, transcript, IELTS score report (if available), representative publications or project experience, a brief research proposal, contact information of two referees.

Subject line: fully-funded PhD application-[your name]

